<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble slipped to 21,000 per dlr in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble slipped to 21,000 per dlr in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 21,000 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 20,900 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    January 23	  January 22</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    21,000		20,900</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $1.737 mln	  $6.603 mln</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
